Server init.
>> a := Blob sabo: 4.
a bytes: ( Jeri sabo ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob sabo: 4.
b bytes: ( Jeri sabo ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a sabo.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Fitarwa rubuta: ['xorred:'], sabon-layi. 
Fitarwa rubuta: n, sabon-layi. 
} kama: { :e Fitarwa rubuta: e, sabon-layi. }, fara.
a saki.
b saki.
